<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">25 June in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">8 events that happened on 25 June, from 841 to 1991.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">841 CE <span class="tih-ago">1,185 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Charles the Bald and Louis the German defeat Lothair I at Fontenoy</h2><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-the-bald">Charles the Bald</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louis-the-german">Louis the German</a> defeated their brother <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lothair-i">Lothair I</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pepin-ii-of-aquitaine">Pepin II of Aquitaine</a> at Fontenoy, the largest battle of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/carolingian-civil-war">Carolingian civil war</a>. It was not decisive: fighting went on until the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-verdun">Treaty of Verdun</a> in 843.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-the-bald">Charles the Bald</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louis-the-german">Louis the German</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lothair-i">Lothair I</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1258">1258 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">768 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Venice defeats a Genoese relief fleet off Acre</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Off <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/acre">Acre</a>, the Venetian fleet won a crushing victory over a larger Genoese fleet under Rosso della Turca, sent to break the Venetian <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/naval-blockade">blockade</a> of the Genoese quarter. It was part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-saint-sabas">War of Saint Sabas</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-saint-sabas">War of Saint Sabas</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1401">1401 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">625 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Jews accused of a blood libel are burned in Schaffhausen</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">In Schaffhausen, in present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/switzerland">Switzerland</a>, 30 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jews">Jews</a> accused in a blood libel of murdering a four-year-old boy were tortured into confessing and burned. The town's Jews had already been burned in 1349 after an accusation of well poisoning.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/switzerland">Switzerland</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1678">1678 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">348 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Elena Cornaro Piscopia becomes the first woman to earn a doctorate</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">The Venetian scholar was awarded a doctorate in philosophy by the University of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/padua">Padua</a>. She is the first woman known to have received a university doctoral degree.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1788">1788 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">238 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Virginia ratifies the US Constitution</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Despite <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/patrick-henry">Patrick Henry</a>'s opposition, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a> narrowly ratified, the tenth state to do so. Without the largest state, the new union could hardly have worked.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/cheyenne" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/cheyenne.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1876">1876 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">150 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Lakota and Cheyenne defeat Custer at the Little Bighorn</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Lakota, Northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cheyenne">Cheyenne</a> and Arapaho warriors killed Lieutenant Colonel George Custer and some 268 soldiers in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/montana">Montana</a> Territory. The US Army responded with campaigns that ended Plains resistance.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1950">1950 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">76 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">North Korea invades South Korea</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">North Korean troops crossed the 38th parallel in force. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korean-war">Korean War</a> drew in UN forces and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> and ended in a 1953 armistice near the original line.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korea">Korea</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1991">1991 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">35 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Croatia and Slovenia declare independence</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">The two republics broke away from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yugoslavia">Yugoslavia</a> on the same day. A brief war in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/slovenia">Slovenia</a> was followed by much longer conflicts in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/croatia">Croatia</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bosnia">Bosnia</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yugoslavia">Yugoslavia</a></div></div></li></ol>
